      "title": "File:A Sledge and a Loader's Wagon - geograph.org.uk - 296756.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/A_Sledge_and_a_Loader%27s_Wagon_-_geograph.org.uk_-_296756.jpg",
